// Module 21 — Task 3: Kusto Queries for Agent Observability
//
// Run these queries in:
//   Azure Portal > Application Insights > Logs
//
// App Insights stores OTel spans in the `dependencies` table.
// Span attributes appear in `customDimensions` as key-value pairs.
// Duration is in milliseconds.
//
// ============================================================
// QUERY 1: p95 latency by operation name (last 24 hours)
// ============================================================
// TODO: Write a query that:
//   - Queries the `dependencies` table
//   - Filters to the last 24 hours: where timestamp > ago(24h)
//   - Groups by `name` (the span name: "agent_run", "llm_call", "tool_*")
//   - Computes p95 duration: percentile(duration, 95)
//   - Also computes p50, count, and avg for context
//   - Orders by p95 descending
//
// Starter:
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(24h)
// TODO: summarize p50 = percentile(duration, 50),
//              p95 = percentile(duration, 95),
//              calls = count(),
//              avg_ms = avg(duration)
//       by name
// TODO: order by p95 desc


// ============================================================
// QUERY 2: Total tokens per day (input + output, last 7 days)
// ============================================================
// TODO: Write a query that:
//   - Queries the `dependencies` table
//   - Filters to spans named "llm_call" (or however you named them)
//   - Extracts input and output token counts from customDimensions:
//       toint(customDimensions["gen_ai.usage.input_tokens"])
//       toint(customDimensions["gen_ai.usage.output_tokens"])
//   - Groups by day: bin(timestamp, 1d)
//   - Sums input tokens, output tokens, and total tokens
//   - Renders as a columnchart
//
// Starter:
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where name == "llm_call"
