// ============================================================
// QUERY 3: Tool call error rate per tool, per 5-minute window
// ============================================================
// TODO: Write a query that:
//   - Queries the `dependencies` table
//   - Filters to spans where name startswith "tool_"
//   - Extracts tool name from customDimensions["tool.name"]
//   - Extracts success from customDimensions["tool.success"]
//   - Groups by bin(timestamp, 5m) and tool_name
//   - Computes error_rate = errors / total (as a float 0.0-1.0)
